        "group not onboarded: a temporary eligibility for 66666666-0000-0000-0000-000000000300 will onboard it, then be removed",
        "Graph lists no PIM policy for the member access of group 66666666-0000-0000-0000-000000000100: PIM for Groups has not onboarded the group yet. The deployment requests a PT1H member eligibility for 66666666-0000-0000-0000-000000000300 (justification 'EARM onboarding of 66666666-0000-0000-0000-000000000100 for policy management'), waits for Graph to list the group's policy, removes the eligibility, and then applies the declared rules to that policy; nothing else is created"
      ]
